We've made several adjustments to the Surge Colossus based on player feedback:


[h1]Patch Notes[/h1]

[b]Upgrade Price:[/b]
[list]
[*]Price reduced from {110, 140, 220, 300} to {110, 130, 210, 290}
[/list]

[b]Base Damage[/b]
[list]
[*]Minimum damage increased from {4, 4, 4, 4} to {3, 5, 7, 9}
[*]Maximum damage increased from {4, 4, 4, 4} to {4, 6, 9, 12}
[/list]

[b]Range:[/b]
[list]
[*] Range adjusted from {160, 160, 160, 160} to {130, 140, 150, 160}
[*] Bounce range increased from {130} to {140}
[/list]

[b]Bounce Damage Factor:[/b]
[list]
[*] Bounce Damage Factor adjusted from {1.0, 1.1, 1.25, 1.35} to {1.05, 1.1, 1.15, 1.25}
[/list] 

[b]Ray Timing (Rof):[/b]
[list]
[*] Minimum rate of fire increased from {0.85, 0.65, 0.45, 0.35} to {1.05, 0.95, 0.75, 0.55}
[*] Maximum rate of fire increased from {1.15, 0.95, 0.75, 0.55} to {1.15, 1.05, 0.85, 0.65}
[/list]

[b]Bounces:[/b]
[list]
[*] Maximum bounces matched with minimum bounces to remove rng.
[*] Maximum bounces reduced from {2, 3, 4, 5} to {1, 2, 3, 4}
[/list]

[b]Crystallize Upgrade:[/b]
[list]
[*] Price adjusted from {150, 100, 100} to {150, 150, 150}
[*] Increased damage factor increased from {1.2, 1.2, 1.2} to {1.3, 1.3, 1.3}
[/list]

[b]Electrical Surge Upgrade:[/b]
[list]
[*] Price adjusted from {300, 150, 150} to {200, 200, 200}
[*] Cooldown reduced from {45, 40, 35} to {40, 35, 30}
[/list]

Try the new changes and let us know what you think!
